<title>UK: LME concludes slow session mixed, nickel weak.</title>
<headline>LME concludes slow session mixed, nickel weak.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Perks up in late trade, closes steadier but business mostly routine.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Finishes higher, edges up towards $1,550 by close.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ends weak, slumps under $6,400 to new 2-1/4 year low.</p>
<p>LEAD - Closes with pared losses, holds above $700.</p>
<p>ZINC - Finishes lower, but trade slow. TIN/ALLOY - Steady.</p>
</text>
